Encargados de Area
├── Servicios  ->   systemctl
├── Logs -> jornalctl o dmesk(K)
├── Red -> networkctl
├── DNS -> resolvectl 
├── Hora -> timedatectl  
├── Hostname -> hotsnamectl  
├── Usuarios/Sesiones 
├── Locales y teclado -> localectl
├── Boot ->  systemd-analize
└── Performance 

ALMACENAMIENTOS Y CONFIGURACIONES
├── Servicios   
        conf ADMIN >/etc/systemd/system/
        conf PKG> /usr/lib/system/system

├── Logs  /run/log/journal/ OR /var/log/journal
        conf /etc/systemd/journal

├── Red DELEGA NetPlan .yml or NetworkManager nmcli
        conf /etc/systemd/network

├── DNS  DELEGA DHCP, NetPlan, NM, etc.
        conf /etc/systemd/resolved.conf

├── Hora /etc/localtime,  puede delegar CHRONYD o NTPD
        conf /etc/systemd/timesyncd.conf

├── Hostname  /etc/hostname,  /etc/hosts (statics)

├── Usuarios/Sesiones
        conf /etc/systemd/logind.conf

├── Locales y teclado /usr/lib/locale/  /etc/default/keyboard
        conf /etc/default/locale

├── Boot   systemd-analizy
└── Performance commands check cpu, mem, I/O, network, boot
